	<div>
		<div>
	<span class="type">ACCOUNTABILITY</span>
		<span class="date">25 September 2026</span>
		</div>
	<h3>
	Hearing at the European Parliament	<br></h3>

	<p>President Christine Lagarde will speak on Monday, 28 September before the European Parliament’s Committee on Economic and Monetary Affairs and answer questions from its members. The hearing will be webcast live and starts at 16:00 CET.</p>

		</div>

</div>
<div class="box">

			
		<div data-image="/home/shared/img/bas/box-2_ad15dc65d9e8fd30573d9133cc0bb1b5.jpg"
	data-image-webp="/home/shared/img/bas/box-2_ad15dc65d9e8fd30573d9133cc0bb1b5.webp"
	>
</div>
	<div>
		<div>
	<span class="type">PRESS RELEASE</span>
		<span class="date">24 September 2026</span>
		</div>
	<h3>
	Executive Board member Isabel Schnabel resigns for IMF role	<br></h3>

	<p>Isabel Schnabel, member of the Executive Board and the Governing Council announced that she will step down from the ECB in early January 2027 to take up a senior role at the IMF.</p>

					<a href="/press/pr/date/2026/html/ecb.pr260924~bea1dd9824.en.html">Read the press release</a>
						</div>

</div>
<div class="box">

			
		<div data-image="/home/shared/img/bas/box-3_d5c9944b57fc5988f504025f2feaa7a1.jpg"
	data-image-webp="/home/shared/img/bas/box-3_d5c9944b57fc5988f504025f2feaa7a1.webp"
	>
</div>
	<div>
		<div>
	<span class="type">THE ECB BLOG</span>
		<span class="date">24 September 2026</span>
		</div>
	<h3>
	How policymakers’ speeches move markets 	<br></h3>

	<p>Policymakers’ speeches and interviews can move financial markets by just as much as monetary policy decisions. This ECB Blog post shows how speaking engagements can also be used to help measure the effects of monetary policy on euro area inflation and unemployment.</p>

					<a href="/press/blog/date/2026/html/ecb.blog20260924~3240af33dc.en.html">Read The ECB Blog</a>
						</div>

</div> 
        </div>
